---
import Action from './ui/Action.astro';
import TextLink from './ui/TextLink.astro';
import LinkCard from './ui/LinkCard.astro';
---
<main class="pressure-encounter">
      <div class="pressure-encounter__intro">
        <h1>Products and workflows, working cleanly.</h1>
        <p class="pressure-encounter__positioning">I help founders and teams close UX, accessibility and implementation gaps in fast-built and AI-assisted products.</p>
        <p class="pressure-encounter__practice">Twenty years in UX, product strategy and design systems, shaped by thirty years of Tai Chi practice.</p>
        <nav class="pressure-encounter__work-links" aria-label="Ways to work with James">
          <LinkCard recipe="primary" href="/uxui" title="Product Clarity" description="UX review and implementation" />
          <LinkCard recipe="secondary" href="/systems" title="Workflow Systems" description="Operational workflow design and build" />
        </nav>
        <aside class="pressure-encounter__proof" aria-label="Recent delivery example">
          <p class="pressure-encounter__proof-label">Recent delivery</p>
          <p>In client feedback, the owner said an operational app I built gave supervisors clearer visibility into to-dos, quality control and measurements. <TextLink recipe="proof" href="/systems#client-example">See the example</TextLink>.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="pressure-encounter__reflection-intro">
        <h2>Pressure rarely stays where it begins.</h2>
        <p>It moves through the person, the room, and the work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pressure-encounter__prompt">
        <p>Where is it showing up?</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pressure-encounter__rings" aria-label="Choose where the pressure is showing up">
        <img src="/images/pressure-rings.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        <button type="button" data-pressure-path="work">In the work</button>
        <button type="button" data-pressure-path="team">In a team</button>
        <button type="button" data-pressure-path="self">In me</button>
      </div>

      <Action recipe="text" data-home-action="explore" data-pressure-path="explore">
        I am only exploring
      </Action>

      <Action recipe="quiet" data-home-action="browse" data-browse>
        Browse without answering
      </Action>
    </main>
